  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two capacitors having capacitance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> respectively are connected as shown in figure. Initially, capacitor <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> is charged to a potential difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math> volt by a battery. The battery is then removed and the charged capacitor <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> is now connected to uncharged capacitor <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> by closing the switch <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>. The amount of charge on the capacitor <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, after equilibrium, is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/221a47f3-c3b4-48a4-84ab-daf101c6fa10-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 105px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "5qFq3",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mi>V</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wbnkY",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi>V</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vn2m3",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>V</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0oWet",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>V</mi></math>",
